WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:02.610
- We're seconds away from season two

00:00:02.610 --> 00:00:04.170
of the Drew Barrymore show.

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:06.350
They say go big or go home

00:00:06.350 --> 00:00:07.790
but we're gonna do both.

00:00:07.790 --> 00:00:09.121
Fire this thing up

00:00:09.121 --> 00:00:10.250
(car roaring)
(car hooting)

00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:13.940
because there truly is no place like home.

00:00:13.940 --> 00:00:16.100
I'm going coast to coast from New York

00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:18.610
to California, and everywhere in between

00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:21.070
to celebrate all our hometowns.

00:00:21.070 --> 00:00:24.410
So let's do this from the
place I was born and raised.

00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:26.997
Hello, Hollywood.

00:00:26.997 --> 00:00:29.621
This is The Drew Barrymore Show.

00:00:29.621 --> 00:00:34.621
(audience cheering)
(upbeat music)

00:00:40.657 --> 00:00:42.873
Hello, everybody.

00:00:42.873 --> 00:00:44.540
Hello, hello, hello.

00:00:46.456 --> 00:00:47.784
Welcome.

00:00:47.784 --> 00:00:50.270
I can't believe we're here.

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:51.540
This is all for you guys

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:53.240
and it means so much to all of us

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:58.240
because you are our very first
in-person studio audience.

00:00:58.311 --> 00:01:01.311
(audience cheering)

00:01:05.408 --> 00:01:08.240
We didn't have the privilege
of that in year one.

00:01:08.240 --> 00:01:10.160
And what a way to kick things off.

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:13.356
We are here in my hometown of Hollywood

00:01:13.356 --> 00:01:16.080
(audience cheering)

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:20.263
at the iconic Paramount Studios.

00:01:21.325 --> 00:01:23.750
(audience cheering)

00:01:23.750 --> 00:01:28.224
My grandfather, John Barrymore, shot here.

00:01:28.224 --> 00:01:29.418
(audience cheering)

00:01:29.418 --> 00:01:31.092
I love that, hello, hello.

00:01:31.092 --> 00:01:33.675
(upbeat music)

